

>> Cat := Oġġett ġdid.

Cat meta: ['ġdid'] agħmel: {
	proprju sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat meta: ['nieuw'] agħmel: {
	proprju sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat meta: ['makeSound'] agħmel: { <- proprju sound.
}.

Cat meta: ['greet'] agħmel: { <- innifsu makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat ġdid.
Ħruġ ikteb: cat greet.
